<title>USA: Fonar says it settled suits with Siemens.</title>
<headline>Fonar says it settled suits with Siemens.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonar Corp said on Wednesday it resolved litigation with Siemens AG in which each party alleged infringements on patents relating to magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) technology.</p>
<p>The settlement agreement, in which neither party admits liability, includes a cross-license of certain MRI technology patents, Fonar said.</p>
<p>The company said it would receive a monetary payment from Siemens and an agreement under which Siemens would pay it royalties.</p>
<p>The amounts were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
